        <p>By accessing or using NovBank's platform, website, and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing our services. These terms apply to all users, visitors, and others who access or use the service.</p>
