        <h2>3. Identity Verification (KYC)</h2>
        <p>In compliance with European Union anti-money laundering directives and financial regulations, all NovBank users are required to complete a Know Your Customer (KYC) verification process before accessing full account features. This involves submitting a valid government-issued identity document.</p>
        <p>NovBank reserves the right to suspend or permanently close accounts where identity verification cannot be completed or where fraudulent documents are detected. Submission of false or misleading identification documents may result in immediate account termination and referral to appropriate law enforcement authorities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. Financial Services and Transactions</h2>
        <p>NovBank provides the following financial services to verified account holders: internal transfers between NovBank accounts, international wire transfers via IBAN and SWIFT, deposit requests, airtime recharges, loan applications, and virtual debit card issuance.</p>
        <p>All transactions are subject to review and approval by NovBank's compliance team. NovBank reserves the right to delay, hold, cancel or reverse any transaction that it reasonably suspects to be fraudulent, unlawful, or in violation of these terms. Wire transfers and deposits are subject to a processing period of 1 to 3 business days.</p>
        <p>You are solely responsible for ensuring the accuracy of all transaction details including recipient account numbers, IBANs and SWIFT codes. NovBank accepts no liability for funds sent to incorrect recipients as a result of user error.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. Transaction PIN</h2>
        <p>A 4-digit transaction PIN is required to authorise all financial transactions on NovBank. You are responsible for keeping your PIN confidential. NovBank staff will never ask you for your PIN. If you suspect your PIN has been compromised, you must change it immediately through your account settings.</p>
        <p>NovBank accepts no liability for unauthorised transactions resulting from your failure to keep your PIN secure. You may reset your PIN using your account password from the Profile section of your dashboard.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>6. Loan Services</h2>
        <p>Loan applications are subject to review and approval at NovBank's sole discretion. Submission of a loan application does not guarantee approval. Approved loan funds are credited directly to your account balance and may be used for any lawful purpose.</p>
        <p>By submitting a loan application, you confirm that all information provided is accurate and truthful. NovBank reserves the right to recall any loan amount where false information was provided during the application process. Repayment terms will be communicated to you upon loan approval.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>7. Card Services</h2>
        <p>Virtual debit cards issued by NovBank are linked to your account balance. Card requests are subject to approval and issuance by NovBank's team. NovBank reserves the right to block or cancel any card at any time where fraudulent, suspicious or unauthorised activity is detected.</p>
        <p>You are responsible for the security of your card details. You must not share your card number, CVV or expiry date with any unauthorised party. NovBank accepts no liability for unauthorised transactions resulting from your failure to secure your card details.</p>
      </div>

